  "notes": [
    "TEST only. S16, 25 facilities; loops only 10/25 and 15/25, 600 seconds max, 5 slots, 2-second replacement, independent 5% elite selection including opening. Boss only 15/25, 120 seconds max.",
    "B1 only, no regen affixes/purple/chapter-three gear/potions; one 2% kill-heal affix with existing opportunity cost. Warrior target weight 3. Existing AI and skills retained.",
    "Guard base DR remains 22; effective DR 27 strictly above half HP, 22 at/below half HP.",
    "Wolf charge speed buff triggers only on successful skill hit, not basics; nonstacking four-second refresh.",
    "Champion fervor trigger rate denominator is all champions spawned before run ends; late spawns can be censored.",
    "Killed enemy mean lifetime includes spawn-to-death time for enemies actually killed; not isolated one-on-one kill times.",
    "Coverage is observed run-time fraction; trio spike counts direct enemy damage only while shaman, rider and champion coexist, excludes environment damage.",
    "Boss threshold summons use full normal templates. They never respawn; boss death dismisses living summons without kill rewards. Kill healing is disabled; existing other kill triggers are unchanged. This combat-only simulator does not issue EXP or drops.",
    "Summon lifetime ends on death, boss dismissal, wipe or timeout. Summon damage is pooled per run. Buff modifiers do not stack on retrigger."
  ]
